# 2. IMPORTANT DUNGEON RULE

Once a Party enters a Dungeon Mission:

# **THE PARTY IS LOCKED INTO THE MISSION.**

The Master cannot manually remove the Party from the active Dungeon.

```text
PARTY
  ↓
ENTER DUNGEON
  ↓
MISSION START
  ↓
PARTY LOCK
  ↓
MISSION ACTIVE
```

During the active mission:

```text
Master cannot:
- Remove Hero
- Replace Hero
- Recall Party
- Transfer Hero
- Disband Party
- Change Party Leader
- Move Hero to another Party
```

The Party can only leave the Dungeon through a valid system result.

Valid exit conditions:

```text
MISSION VICTORY
MISSION FAILURE
SPECIAL SYSTEM-MANDATED ESCAPE
EMERGENCY EVENT
DUNGEON FORCED EXIT
```

A normal Master command cannot cancel an active Dungeon Mission.

